Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.30,0:00:12.80,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Wh-Why do you hate Lady Tiararose so?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.83,0:00:20.72,Flashback,Sea Fairy1,0,0,0,,Icilla is sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.72,0:00:22.46,Flashback,Sea Fairy2,0,0,0,,That makes us sad, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.46,0:00:27.60,Flashback,Sea Fairy3,0,0,0,,Let's go bully that Tiararose lady \Nwho took her true love from her!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.60,0:00:28.67,Flashback,Sea Fairy1/2,0,0,0,,{\t(1053,1804,\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.04,0:00:34.43,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Is it because I have feelings \Nfor Prince Aquasteed?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.75,0:00:35.92,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,Don't you dare...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.85,0:00:38.88,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,let the fact that you have \Nthe fairies' blessing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.88,0:00:40.91,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,and were able to come here
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.91,0:00:42.98,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,get to your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.92,0:00:45.94,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I-I'm very sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.99,0:00:52.62,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,Incidentally, Icilla...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.29,0:00:55.97,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,Are you familiar with what \Ngoes on around Tiararose?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.41,0:00:58.00,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,W-Well, somewhat...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.73,0:01:02.00,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,Then are you aware of \NClaire's current circumstances?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.64,0:01:04.21,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Claire?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.21,0:01:08.00,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry. I don't know who that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.00,0:01:12.47,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,What? After I opened the path \Nfor you to come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.88,0:01:15.35,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,Enough. Leave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.23,0:01:32.95,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,He said he would come \Nand have tea with me...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.24,0:01:38.99,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,If I just use this...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.68,0:01:58.39,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an2\c&HFC8A3D&\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\fs28\3c&HFDFBFA&\b1\fad(604,100)\t(20,4733,\fs23)\move(336,79,336,93,20,4733)\c&HB36BF7&\t(3108,3108,\c&H5280F6&)\t(3191,3191,\c&HACF29E&)\t(3399,3399,\c&H19D3F7&)\t(3775,3775,\c&HFC8A3D&)}The Villainess {\c&H343E6B&\t(3108,3108,\c&H754D00&)\t(3191,3191,\c&H6286B0&)\t(3399,3399,\c&H334A70&)\t(3775,3775,\c&H343E6B&)}Is {\c&HB36BF7&\t(3108,3108,\c&HEF65A0&)\t(3191,3191,\c&H7B72F5&)\t(3399,3399,\c&HEFF400&)\t(3775,3775,\c&HB36BF7&)}Adored \N{\c&H343E6B&\t(3108,3108,\c&H754D00&)\t(3191,3191,\c&H6286B0&)\t(3399,3399,\c&H334A70&)\t(3775,3775,\c&H343E6B&)}by the Prince of the Neighbor Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.71,0:03:15.97,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(560,1)\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\b1\pos(320,123)\c&HB36BF7&\3c&HFCFCFC&\fs25}Whisper{\b0} {\c&H343E6B&}That You {\c&HFC8A3D&\b1}Love{\b0} {\c&H343E6B&}Me
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.82,0:03:24.79,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,So you were able to meet \Nthe Sea Fairy King,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.79,0:03:26.57,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,but you were immediately sent away?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.00,0:03:28.35,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.75,0:03:32.57,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I couldn't give up so soon, \Nso I dove down several more times...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.42,0:03:38.69,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,but I was not allowed near \Nthe Fairy King's shrine again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.20,0:03:42.84,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Please try not to feel so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.84,0:03:45.66,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,The cookies really aren't that important.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.04,0:03:48.84,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.34,0:03:55.13,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'll see if I can sort this out by my—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.86,0:04:00.96,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Claire?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.67,0:04:03.14,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,I came to visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.14,0:04:04.82,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,King Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.90,0:04:07.60,Italics,Icilla,0,0,0,,King... Claire?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.60,0:04:10.31,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,What, you're just ignoring me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.31,0:04:11.84,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Keith!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.52,0:04:15.91,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,I heard that you'd been having \Ntea with Claire recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.61,0:04:18.53,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,It's been a while, Tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.21,0:04:30.37,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,I brought you a lovely gift today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.85,0:04:32.54,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,It's coral tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.96,0:04:34.88,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,You can make tea from coral?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.30,0:04:38.97,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,You're the Sky Fairy King, \Nyet you brought coral tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.97,0:04:42.39,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,That's right. It's my favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.39,0:04:46.69,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,I did get it from Pearl, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.69,0:04:48.39,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,But it's good, so I'm sharing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.94,0:04:50.14,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Pearl?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.57,0:04:59.35,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,It has the fragrance of the sea \Nand sweet flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.35,0:05:00.99,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Isn't it lovely?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.53,0:05:06.04,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara is my wife. \NDon't get too close to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.40,0:05:09.75,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Oh, Aquasteed, you're no fun at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.70,0:05:13.54,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,You'd better keep a tight \Nhold on her, or I'll take her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.54,0:05:17.03,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Keith! I only have eyes for Prince Aqua!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.68,0:05:19.05,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Same goes for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.38,0:05:24.11,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,You really are head-over-heels \Nfor each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.35,0:05:27.25,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,I envy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.37,0:05:44.11,Italics,Icilla INT,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.17,0:05:50.83,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,I thought I might get to see you \Nif I used coral tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.83,0:05:53.60,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,King Claire, who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.60,0:05:57.42,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Oh, right. You two haven't \Nmet her yet, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.82,0:06:01.42,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,This is Pearl, the Sea Fairy King.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.33,0:06:09.26,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,What are you so angry about, Pearl?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.26,0:06:11.96,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Come, now. \NYou need to return their greeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.96,0:06:13.94,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,Do not give me orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.94,0:06:16.31,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,Just look at you, \Na {\i1}man{\i0} dressing that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.41,0:06:18.52,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Pearl...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.52,0:06:21.42,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,What? King Claire is a man?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.51,0:06:24.45,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I should expect no less \Nof the fairy kings.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.45,0:06:26.84,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,They're all such unique individuals!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.34,0:06:30.17,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I can't believe all three of them \Nare here at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.13,0:06:38.10,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,Claire, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.14,0:06:48.44,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Pearl said she hated men,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.44,0:06:52.10,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,so I started dressing like this in hopes \Nthat we could be friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.10,0:06:54.72,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,You favor Pearl that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.72,0:06:57.80,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,But surely just dressing like a woman \Nwon't make her like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.80,0:07:01.61,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,I know, but it was \Nthe only way I could think of.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.16,0:07:03.58,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,King Claire...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.58,0:07:05.32,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Shh, Tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.32,0:07:11.46,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,We humans mustn't try to interfere \Nin the fairy kings' affairs carelessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.14,0:07:13.83,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.58,0:07:17.37,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I'm sure his idea that \Nshe hates him is a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.37,0:07:20.90,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I'll feel so bad for them \Nif their misunderstanding continues.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.56,0:07:25.62,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Also, if Keith knew that, \Nhe should've said so!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.26,0:07:31.70,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,But I won't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.15,0:07:36.06,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,I'll just keep closing the distance \Nbetween Pearl and me little by little.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.34,0:07:39.65,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah? Good luck with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.65,0:07:43.58,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Oh, I know. Maybe \NI'll give her some sort of gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.58,0:07:47.22,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Would you mind going shopping \Nwith me sometime soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.22,0:07:50.82,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,I don't know what would \Nmake a good gift for a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.18,0:07:54.01,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,If you think I can help, I would love to!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.47,0:08:03.88,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I don't think King Pearl \Nhates King Claire at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.88,0:08:06.30,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I'm almost certain \Nshe actually likes him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.16,0:08:14.13,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Did seeing me enjoy tea time with \Nthe other kings make King Pearl upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.02,0:08:16.19,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.19,0:08:17.94,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Y-Y-Y-You're kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.94,0:08:20.69,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,The Sea Fairy King came here in person?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.69,0:08:22.94,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,What are you plotting?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.94,0:08:23.78,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.78,0:08:25.54,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,What was that tea party for?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.54,0:08:27.15,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.15,0:08:30.27,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,Trying to win the fairy kings over \Nwith tasty sweets?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.27,0:08:32.40,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,You obviously have ulterior motives!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.76,0:08:36.96,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Then would you like to join us \Nat our next tea party?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.96,0:08:38.67,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.67,0:08:41.99,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,As if I would ever have tea \Nwith the likes of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.37,0:08:44.21,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'll invite King Claire, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.67,0:08:49.78,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,King Claire seemed very eager \Nto see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.78,0:08:50.88,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,As I said—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.88,0:08:52.47,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I know it'll be fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.47,0:08:54.68,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,You can't invite a fairy king \Nover for tea so casually!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.68,0:08:56.07,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,Know your place!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.68,0:08:58.71,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,I'll let this go for today,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.71,0:09:02.19,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,but if you make things any worse, \NI have some ideas of my own!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.19,0:09:03.94,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,King Pearl, I—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.94,0:09:07.78,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,Silence! I am the Sea Fairy King! \NDo not defy me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.78,0:09:11.61,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,And do not get any closer \Nto the kings—to Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.51,0:09:21.92,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,King Claire...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.53,0:09:24.18,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.18,0:09:25.42,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.91,0:09:31.80,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I can't go with you to choose \Na gift for King Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.49,0:09:34.80,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.12,0:09:42.84,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,You don't want to anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.24,0:09:47.60,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,When choosing a gift \Nfor a woman you like,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.60,0:09:51.99,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I don't think it's wise to go shopping \Nfor it with another woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.33,0:09:54.05,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,The young maiden in me
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.05,0:09:57.99,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,would want such a gift to be chosen \Npersonally by the man buying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.48,0:10:06.29,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm sure she'll be happier \Nwith a gift you chose yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.91,0:10:09.49,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,So that's what a maiden's \Nheart desires, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.13,0:10:17.87,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,In that case, I'll try shopping on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.87,0:10:20.27,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Thank you, Tiararose.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.32,0:10:53.52,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Are you looking for a gift?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.52,0:10:55.38,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.38,0:10:58.16,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,I was thinking of something \Nmade with coral.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.16,0:11:00.68,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,And for the color... I'm not sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.05,0:11:03.06,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Red is beautiful,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.06,0:11:05.62,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,but the colors of the sky \Nand sea are lovely, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.06,0:11:11.70,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,This one is nice. I'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.70,0:11:13.57,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.77,0:11:16.70,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,I hope she'll like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.12,0:11:19.91,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Oh, goodness! These are adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.43,0:11:22.98,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,They'd suit Tiararose perfectly!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.10,0:11:26.48,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Since we've gotten \Nto be such good friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.48,0:11:28.24,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,maybe I'll buy matching ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.98,0:11:36.27,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,Claire...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.15,0:11:39.10,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,He looks so happy about this...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.31,0:11:54.29,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,The seas are getting rough?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.29,0:11:56.31,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Pearl, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.48,0:12:04.95,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,What in the world is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.84,0:12:15.96,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HFC8A3D&\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\fs24\3c&HFDFBFA&\b1\fad(516,1)\pos(328,51)}The Villainess {\c&H343E6B&}Is {\c&HB36BF7&}Adored \N{\c&H343E6B&)}by the Prince of the Neighbor Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.72,0:12:21.56,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I must inform Prince Aquasteed right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.56,0:12:22.79,Default,Sea Fairy1,0,0,0,,Icilla!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.97,0:12:26.48,Default,Sea Fairy1,0,0,0,,Icilla, the king is angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.48,0:12:29.91,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,The fairy king? What has happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.91,0:12:31.73,Default,Sea Fairy2,0,0,0,,She's angry! She's angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.73,0:12:33.73,Default,Sea Fairy3,0,0,0,,She's {\i1}super{\i0} angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.73,0:12:36.21,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,Hey. Don't go acting on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.11,0:12:42.58,Default,Sea Fairies,0,0,0,,King!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.49,0:12:46.87,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,Hmph. I dislike \Nthe woman called Tiararose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.87,0:12:48.91,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,She has some nerve leading Claire on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.29,0:12:51.93,Italics,Icilla INT,0,0,0,,Lady Tiararose did that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.42,0:12:57.30,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,Icilla, you must take Aquasteed \Naway from Tiararose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.30,0:12:58.17,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.53,0:13:06.60,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.60,0:13:08.45,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,The secret elixir of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.40,0:13:11.90,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Secret elixir?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.90,0:13:15.59,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,Yes. If you add one \Ndrop of your blood to it
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.59,0:13:17.56,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,and make Aquasteed drink it,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.56,0:13:20.11,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,his heart will belong to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.65,0:13:25.53,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,His heart? Then this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.29,0:13:27.70,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,a love potion?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.64,0:13:30.17,Italics,Icilla INT,0,0,0,,So with this...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.84,0:13:35.85,Italics,Icilla INT,0,0,0,,I could make Prince Aquasteed love me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.58,0:13:38.81,Italics,Icilla INT,0,0,0,,I know it's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.81,0:13:43.88,Italics,Icilla INT,0,0,0,,I can't just toy with Prince Aquasteed's \Nfeelings however I please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.37,0:13:45.55,Italics,Icilla INT,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.84,0:13:53.02,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Pearl!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.83,0:13:56.10,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.95,0:13:58.62,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,What in the world is wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.22,0:14:02.16,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,I have nothing to say to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.85,0:14:05.27,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.74,0:14:10.41,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Oh, darn it. She just \Nwon't listen to a word I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.37,0:14:19.45,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Lift your head, Icilla Pearllant.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.49,0:14:22.84,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Tell me what has happened to Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.27,0:14:28.60,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,King Pearl said that Lady Tiararose \Nis leading you on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.60,0:14:32.60,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Leading me on? That's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.41,0:14:34.98,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.27,0:14:38.18,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Just what does Pearl think\N is happening here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.75,0:14:42.49,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,It's clear how much Tiararose \Nand Aquasteed love each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.06,0:15:00.17,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Blessings of the forest, please \Nshare a bit of your power with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.82,0:15:05.73,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Since I've received Keith's blessing,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.73,0:15:08.09,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,my magic has made a lot of progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.53,0:15:12.95,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Putting my magic into my sweets \Nseems to make them taste even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.15,0:15:18.48,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,Oh, that's very cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.48,0:15:20.72,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,It's Prince Aquasteed, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.72,0:15:24.57,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,That's right. I thought \NI'd make iced cookies of everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.34,0:15:30.08,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Next is King Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.53,0:15:36.33,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I wonder if he was able to buy that gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.73,0:15:44.63,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,K-King Pearl?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.63,0:15:49.51,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,You... That...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.51,0:15:52.01,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,Is that meant to be in Claire's image?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.01,0:15:53.97,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Th-This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.45,0:15:59.27,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,After all those times I warned you, \Nyou mean to continue leading him on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.27,0:16:03.32,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,You're wrong! I'm making \Ncookies of everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.32,0:16:06.99,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I didn't just make one \Nfor King Claire alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.41,0:16:14.20,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,Well, just enjoy your fun \Nwhile you still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.20,0:16:15.34,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.53,0:16:20.76,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,Soon you will feel \Nthe same pain that I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.41,0:16:30.25,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,Lady Tiararose...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.94,0:16:36.22,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,The sea remains murky and black.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.83,0:16:40.48,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,It looks like we have no choice \Nbut to see Claire and the Sea Fairy King.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.76,0:16:43.04,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Elliot and I will go on horseback.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.04,0:16:46.35,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara and Lady Icilla, \Nplease follow us in a carriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.35,0:16:47.98,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,I'll make arrangements right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.31,0:16:53.58,Flashback Italics,Pearl FB,0,0,0,,Soon you will feel \Nthe same pain that I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.71,0:16:57.95,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,What did she mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.15,0:17:02.45,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.63,0:17:04.92,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,It'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.92,0:17:06.13,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.82,0:17:13.42,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Lady Icilla, is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.11,0:17:15.35,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,N-No...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.91,0:17:21.36,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Let's have tea!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.27,0:17:27.19,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,At a time like this, the best thing \Nto do is calm our minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.46,0:17:30.81,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.90,0:17:37.46,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Water of life, come forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.54,0:17:47.15,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Wow! Thank you, Lady Icilla!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.15,0:17:51.05,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Not at all. This is really \Nthe only way I can be of use.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.05,0:17:52.85,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,That isn't true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.13,0:17:58.31,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Lady Icilla, you are \Na fine caretaker of the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.27,0:18:01.57,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.42,0:18:05.60,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I couldn't stop the sea \Nfrom turning black.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.53,0:18:09.57,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,But you went down to the ocean floor
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.57,0:18:11.48,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,hoping to do something \Nabout it, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.13,0:18:15.90,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Even when the Sea Fairy King stopped you, \Nyou tried over and over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.90,0:18:17.28,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,You didn't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.60,0:18:20.71,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,In that same way, you have \Ndone everything in your power
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.71,0:18:23.67,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,for both the seas and the kingdom \Nfor all these years.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.35,0:18:25.89,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I know that well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.05,0:18:28.94,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Prince Aquasteed...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.85,0:18:33.84,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Here you are, Prince Aqua.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.58,0:18:37.56,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Thank you, Tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.21,0:18:44.50,Flashback Italics,Pearl FB,0,0,0,,If you add one drop of your blood to it
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.50,0:18:46.58,Flashback Italics,Pearl FB,0,0,0,,and make Aquasteed drink it,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.58,0:18:49.26,Flashback Italics,Pearl FB,0,0,0,,his heart will belong to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.90,0:18:51.09,Italics,Icilla INT,0,0,0,,Prince...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.41,0:19:00.39,Italics,Icilla INT,0,0,0,,Prince Aquasteed...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.52,0:19:07.43,Italics,Icilla INT,0,0,0,,Prince Aquasteed!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.26,0:19:14.68,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.68,0:19:17.89,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Lady Icilla, eat with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.70,0:19:21.22,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Lady Tiararose...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.14,0:19:26.09,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'll think about what we can do next, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.09,0:19:27.65,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Let's try our hardest together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.99,0:19:39.74,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,No! Please don't drink that tea,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.74,0:19:41.80,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Prince Aquasteed!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.95,0:19:46.97,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,L-Lady Icilla?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.86,0:19:51.30,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.01,0:19:57.80,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I'm sorry... I... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.52,0:20:03.40,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I put the secret elixir of the sea \Nin Prince Aquasteed's tea!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.61,0:20:06.70,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Secret elixir of the sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.35,0:20:09.70,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I-It's a love potion.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.70,0:20:10.69,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.96,0:20:15.84,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I never would have imagined...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.02,0:20:25.94,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Don't cry, Icilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.19,0:20:35.88,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Low and sweet... The same \Nvoice he uses to talk to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.11,0:20:40.33,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Icilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.94,0:20:49.57,Default,Tarmo,0,0,0,,Prince Aquasteed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.27,0:20:52.13,Default,Tarmo,0,0,0,,You're going to the sea, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.09,0:20:57.44,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,That's right. \NI'll take Icilla there first.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.90,0:21:00.98,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,The sea fairies love Icilla,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.98,0:21:03.05,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,so she should go with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.45,0:21:06.55,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,P-Prince Aqua...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.95,0:21:10.92,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Oh. Tiara, you can wait here \Nat the castle if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.05,0:21:17.04,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,No. It's because of the drug.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.51,0:21:20.55,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,The usual Prince Aqua would never...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.22,0:21:22.31,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Come,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.83,0:21:25.03,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Icilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.76,0:21:31.58,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,No! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.58,0:21:33.94,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Don't touch anyone but me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.39,0:21:39.39,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Prince Aquasteed...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.78,0:21:50.96,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,How long will the gods keep \Nputting me through these trials?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.89,0:21:55.91,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Stop! Look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.35,0:21:57.95,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.97,0:23:40.08,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\3c&HFCFCFC&\fs25\c&H343E6B&\pos(325,123)\blur4\bord1}My {\b1\c&HB36BF7&}Beautiful {\c&HFC8A3D&}Lady{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:23:29.97,0:23:40.08,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\3c&HFCFCFC&\fs25\c&H343E6B&\pos(325,123)\bord1.75}My {\b1\c&HB36BF7&}Beautiful {\c&HFC8A3D&}Lady{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.73,0:23:34.81,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara, you taught me what \Na joy it is to love.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.81,0:23:36.52,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I must convey these feelings now...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.52,0:23:39.35,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,to you, one who is like a flower.
